WEBVTT

00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:04.980
<i>I don't have many memories 
of my dad from when I was young.</i>

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:08.350
<i>All I remember...</i>

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:11.680
<i>I win.</i>

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:13.570
<i>Is that we used to play 
rock, paper, scissors a lot.</i>

00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:14.550
<i>That's not fair!</i>

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:16.720
<i>I only got to eat two!</i>

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:19.550
<i>You're telling me it's not fair 
to decide by rock, paper, scissors?</i>

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:23.380
<i>There are lots of things in 
the world that aren't fair.</i>

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:27.580
<i>But accepting them all is life.</i>

00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:31.480
<i>I didn't understand the 
meaning of the words he used,</i>

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:33.400
<i>or what he was trying to say.</i>

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:34.890
<i>But I remembered it for some reason.</i>

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:39.270
<i>Like he knew what was going 
to happen in the future...</i>

00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:15.990
Killer

00:02:29.310 --> 00:02:31.090
You've gotten a lot better.

00:02:32.310 --> 00:02:34.220
I suppose since you don't have any

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:36.090
preconceptions getting in the 
way, you're learning fast.

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:38.320
You can still get stronger.

00:02:38.630 --> 00:02:40.590
Because you're a Killer.

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:45.220
I've heard that a lot 
since I came here.

00:02:45.800 --> 00:02:47.230
But what's a "Killer"?

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:52.350
All right, I'll tell you.

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:56.610
There once was a nation that conquered

00:02:56.610 --> 00:02:58.080
most of the land of Consume.

00:02:58.820 --> 00:03:00.650
The Great Atarika Empire.

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:03.910
The Atarika Empire was on 
the verge of conquering

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:05.700
the continent with the overwhelming 
size of its forces.

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:08.700
But before that could, it fell apart.

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:10.910
In order to expand its armies,

00:03:10.910 --> 00:03:13.290
it would gather soldiers of any 
kind, no matter what they were.

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:16.880
But because they brought in 
bandits and thugs, as well,

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:21.760
it decreased the quality of their troops
and cost them the people's trust.

00:03:21.760 --> 00:03:24.680
In the end, a coup d'etat 
brought them down.

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:27.470
This was crash was 
known as the Atarika Shock.

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:31.480
I know that, but what does
that have to do with "Killer"?

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:33.190
Let me finish.

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:37.570
After the Atarika Shock, 
Consume fell into chaos.

00:03:38.190 --> 00:03:40.780
But all the nations 
avoided unnecessarily

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:42.320
increasing the size of their armies,

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:45.820
in order to avoid a repeat 
of what happened to Atarika.

00:03:47.530 --> 00:03:49.450
They would make strong 
individual soldiers

00:03:49.450 --> 00:03:51.160
and put them into elite squads.

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:54.580
In other words, quality over quantity.

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:56.710
A race of people with 
power greater than that

00:03:56.710 --> 00:04:00.010
of normal humans were 
created: the Killers.

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:03.340
But why am I one?

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:07.730
Perhaps one of your mom or dad's 
ancestors was a Killer?

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:10.770
I'm told it's genetic.

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:13.390
My family...

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:16.060
Come to think of it, I heard my mom

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:18.610
and dad were both pretty strong.

00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:20.530
Maybe they were.

00:04:20.990 --> 00:04:22.650
They say wars these days

00:04:22.650 --> 00:04:27.200
are decided by how many 
Killers are in an army.

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:29.280
Anyway, that's basically it.

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:32.290
So basically it's just 
a very strong person?

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:37.630
<i>Tejirof didn't tell me at that time...</i>

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:40.800
<i>what the real meaning of 
the name "Killer" was...</i>

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:42.380
<i>or how cruel it was.</i>

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:47.140
Hey, Big Tits.

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:51.350
Gear's training is taken 
care of for a while.

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:53.520
Now it's my turn to train you.

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:56.270
<i>Alone with him?</i>

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:57.770
<i>Hell no.</i>

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:02.440
I-I don't have anything 
to learn from you.

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:07.200
Nice shot.

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:08.030
See?

00:05:08.030 --> 00:05:09.780
My skill with a bow 
is perfect, isn't it?

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:12.750
The bow and arrow's perfect, yeah...

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:14.330
What?

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:15.370
Come out and say it.

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:16.830
You're right.

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:21.160
You have a good eye and 
you're an accurate shot.

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:24.630
But I think you're a little 
lacking as a fighter.

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:32.320
But I can put something better than 
an arrow into your open hole.

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:34.680
Better than an arrow?

00:05:35.140 --> 00:05:36.890
Ranged tactics.

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:37.940
Shooting.

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:39.940
Shooting?

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:41.940
You've never heard of it?

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:43.190
My my...

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:45.940
the Segua army's full of 
cherries and virgins, huh?

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:51.910
Every Killer has a style of 
combat they're best with.

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:55.250
In Gear's case, for example,

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:58.830
the ability to change life 
energy into power, Action.

00:05:58.830 --> 00:05:59.980
In my and Ramses's case,

00:05:59.980 --> 00:06:04.170
it's Puzzle, the ability to rearrange life 
energy into other kinds of energy.

00:06:04.710 --> 00:06:07.220
And yours is Shooting.

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:10.220
A method of combat created

00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:13.890
by the legendary invader 
of Consume, I. Vazer.

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:15.810
If you can master it,

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:18.770
you'll be able to fight at long range

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:21.190
while still taking advantage 
of your skill with a bow.

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:25.390
I'll show you how to 
do it the first time.

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:29.240
A girl like you should be able 
to take it the rest of the way.

00:06:29.530 --> 00:06:32.410
Concentrate your mind 
on these three fingers.

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:37.580
Don't relax until I tell you to.

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:39.790
<i>What?</i>

00:06:39.790 --> 00:06:42.160
<i>Something's gathering in my fingers...</i>

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:44.000
<i>My fingers...</i>

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:46.460
<i>are going to explode!</i>

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:48.920
Hey... stop!

00:06:48.920 --> 00:06:51.140
Not yet. Endure it.

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:53.470
How long do I have to endure this?

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:55.680
No!

00:06:56.430 --> 00:06:57.470
<i>I...</i>

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:01.480
<i>I can't hold it in anymore!</i>

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:11.530
That's the basic skill 
of Shooting. "Shot."

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:16.290
For the next four days you 
need to learn to master it.

00:07:17.910 --> 00:07:19.160
Four days, huh?

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:21.250
Fine. I'll do it.

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:25.090
I understand the theory.

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:27.460
Hold... and then fire, right?

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:29.920
Don't be in such a hurry.

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:32.720
First practice gathering the energy...

00:07:35.180 --> 00:07:37.810
I can't control the power 
as much as I'd like to yet.

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:41.850
But I can do this.

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:43.060
If I've got four days.

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:44.810
There he is!

00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:48.190
There you are, Tejirof-san.

00:07:48.860 --> 00:07:52.570
You're Gear's little sister, 
Nel-chan, right?

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:54.200
Yes.

00:07:56.410 --> 00:07:57.830
You remembered me!

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:00.330
My brother's looking for you.

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:02.670
He says he wants more training.

00:08:02.670 --> 00:08:05.500
Yeah, I was just on my way.

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:07.250
Don't rush me.

00:08:07.730 --> 00:08:11.090
I'm surprised you knew 
I was here, though.

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:13.880
Shooting practice is dangerous,

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:17.010
so I'd thought I'd chosen a 
place where no one would come.

00:08:17.010 --> 00:08:22.350
Um, I thought I could hear 
your voice coming from here.

00:08:23.140 --> 00:08:23.850
My voice...

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:28.980
<i>Did she find me just from my voice?</i>

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:31.820
<i>I'd heard that when Maxley 
village was attacked,</i>

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:34.490
<i>she survived, even though she 
was only a child, but...</i>

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:37.120
<i>Does the power of a Killer</i>

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:40.490
<i>sleep within her, too?</i>

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:42.750
Hey, Ears.

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:46.580
How do you feel about 
helping your brother out?

00:08:52.460 --> 00:08:54.130
W-Wow...

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:57.890
She was really able to dodge all 
those arrows at this range?

00:09:00.140 --> 00:09:02.900
Did I really do this?

00:09:03.390 --> 00:09:06.190
Yes. Your power was just dormant.

00:09:06.810 --> 00:09:09.520
There's no doubt about it. 
You're a Killer.

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:20.410
How does it feel to be awakened?

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:22.410
Amazing...

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:24.830
I can see far away.

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:27.880
I can hear perfectly, too.

00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:31.460
And my body can feel even 
the slightest breeze.

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:33.710
This is

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:35.810
my...

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:38.050
It seems you have the power

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:42.850
to attune your senses to the 
surrounding area: Online.

00:09:43.430 --> 00:09:45.480
I'm sure it'll grow to be 
something more in the future,

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:48.440
but even now, you could go into combat

00:09:48.440 --> 00:09:49.860
and be very helpful.

00:09:50.810 --> 00:09:52.400
I won't force you.

00:09:53.230 --> 00:09:55.690
I'll leave the decision to you.

00:09:58.570 --> 00:09:59.490
Combat?

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:00.990
Me?

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:02.990
<i>Til...</i>

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:05.540
<i>Brother...</i>

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:08.000
All right.

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:11.000
I'll... I'll fight, too!

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:13.960
So all four are ready?

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:16.090
That's good.

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:19.510
Ramses, I want to confirm something...

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:21.470
Does Gear know?

00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:25.980
Since I first saw him, 
I thought that might be the case...

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:30.020
A survivor of Maxley, and a Killer.

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:32.560
And when I saw that power, I was certain.

00:10:33.190 --> 00:10:37.240
He's the son of General Alex.

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:40.240
And you're going through 
with this cruel plan?

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:46.660
Segua can't lose all of its generals.

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:48.100
Does it bother you?

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:50.250
Nope. Not at all.

00:10:50.670 --> 00:10:54.140
If I get paid, I'll do any job, 
no matter how dirty.

00:10:54.550 --> 00:10:56.650
I'm a dirty guy to begin with.

00:10:56.920 --> 00:11:00.000
Take care of Gear.

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:12.190
Hey, Tejirof.

00:11:12.860 --> 00:11:14.770
How many Killers are there?

00:11:15.270 --> 00:11:17.940
How many of them?

00:11:18.780 --> 00:11:19.990
I don't know.

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:21.870
Maybe hundreds?

00:11:22.530 --> 00:11:25.700
Then just tell me the strong ones.

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:28.200
Let me see... the strong 
ones would be...

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:33.210
The Emperor of the Ninteldo Empire, 
the perfect Killer: Marcus.

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:34.960
Ninteldo's number two,

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:38.170
the genius who's known as the 
"Man who solves all mysteries:"

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:39.210
Zelig.

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:41.970
The princess of one of 
their allied nations,

00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:47.220
Slovia, said to be of the highest 
quality in Consume: Crystal.

00:11:47.680 --> 00:11:50.430
The Samurai CEO of the 
republic of Havid: Kichou.

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:55.770
The undefeated martial artist 
of the Ganp Federation: Tofig.

00:11:56.940 --> 00:11:58.400
And the man who's

00:11:58.400 --> 00:12:01.360
known as the only hero 
on the continent,

00:12:01.360 --> 00:12:03.570
Myomuto, of the Elil Republic.

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:05.490
Even Marcus avoided fighting him.

00:12:05.780 --> 00:12:08.200
They would be the ones to look out for.

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:12.000
Of course, there are Killers in Tatoland, 
which we're attacking tomorrow.

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:15.630
D. Fisher, said to be three times 
the size of an ordinary man.

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:19.090
The younger of the cursed 
Brothers, the drinker, Boys.

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:21.260
The older of the cursed Brothers,

00:12:21.260 --> 00:12:23.510
said to be the strongest 
in Tatoland, Bays.

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:27.180
But all of them are people 
we'll have to defeat.

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:30.470
If you want to get better, that is.

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:32.430
Yeah, I know.

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:34.520
We'll have to defeat them.

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:39.650
Sometimes you have to sacrifice 
something to become stronger.

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:42.280
Are you prepared for that?

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:45.280
Yes. I still want to become stronger.

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:49.410
Hey, kid.

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:53.330
When did you realize you 
wanted to join the military?

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:55.670
I don't know...

00:12:55.670 --> 00:12:58.080
Maybe it was because 
my dad was a soldier?

00:12:59.590 --> 00:13:02.340
I haven't seen him since 
I went to the village

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:04.550
when I was five, so I don't 
really remember, but...

00:13:04.930 --> 00:13:09.560
I do remember watching him defeat lots of 
soldiers at once during practice matches.

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:11.770
It may have been watching that

00:13:11.770 --> 00:13:14.270
when I decided to join the military.

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:19.690
I thought if I joined, 
I might be able to see him.

00:13:20.230 --> 00:13:23.230
But so far, I didn't see 
anybody who looked like him.

00:13:24.360 --> 00:13:27.410
I wonder what he's doing now.

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:29.910
Maybe he's dead.

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:31.160
I don't know.

00:13:32.300 --> 00:13:35.830
Well... Maybe if you're a good boy, 
you'll get to see him.

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:41.090
Our primary objective for today's operation

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:46.550
is to rescue General Alex, 
who's being held in an underground cell.

00:13:47.340 --> 00:13:50.430
While the decoy force draws 
the enemy towards the front,

00:13:50.430 --> 00:13:56.020
we'll go in from the back, 
and head straight to his cell.

00:13:57.690 --> 00:14:00.730
We'll avoid standing out or getting 
into any unnecessary fights.

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:06.030
So Ears will use her Online 
to search for traps and enemies.

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:06.780
Right.

00:14:06.780 --> 00:14:09.070
Opal will snipe from far away.

00:14:09.070 --> 00:14:09.740
Leave it to me.

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:12.120
And if we need you to, Gear,

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:14.540
you'll break through with your speed.

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:15.790
Yeah.

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:19.710
And if things get bad, 
just remain calm.

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:22.500
I'll handle it.

00:14:25.260 --> 00:14:26.590
Advance!

00:14:27.050 --> 00:14:27.970
It's the Segua army!

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:30.010
The Segua army is attacking!

00:14:30.010 --> 00:14:30.970
Everybody to your posts!

00:14:34.260 --> 00:14:35.350
It's started.

00:14:35.770 --> 00:14:36.730
Okay, let's hurry.

00:14:37.890 --> 00:14:38.980
Hold up, guys.

00:14:39.610 --> 00:14:41.730
There's a Seguan who's 
collapsed over there.

00:14:42.150 --> 00:14:43.150
Who?

00:14:43.150 --> 00:14:44.230
A scout?

00:14:53.240 --> 00:14:55.490
You're one of the scouts...

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:58.210
We underestimated them.

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:00.120
Be careful.

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:02.460
He's waiting at the rear gate.

00:15:03.090 --> 00:15:05.110
The strongest warrior of Tatoland.

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:06.800
Bays!

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:09.340
Bays, huh?

00:15:09.340 --> 00:15:10.510
That's a problem.

00:15:11.090 --> 00:15:12.610
I'm done for.

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:14.220
I'm going to die here.

00:15:14.760 --> 00:15:17.980
But... you guys are Killers, right?

00:15:17.980 --> 00:15:22.600
Please! Any of you! Absorb me.

00:15:23.610 --> 00:15:27.110
Please... absorb me...

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:29.780
Absorb you?

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:31.450
Impossible.

00:15:34.950 --> 00:15:36.410
You know that.

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:39.160
You're not powerful enough.

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:40.580
Give up.

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:43.330
We'll avenge you, if nothing else.

00:15:43.790 --> 00:15:45.670
So rest in peace.

00:15:48.590 --> 00:15:50.130
You're right...

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:56.010
Bring victory to Segua for me...

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:03.230
What did he mean by absorb?

00:16:03.810 --> 00:16:04.900
That's right.

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:06.440
You don't know yet, do you?

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:07.730
I guess you wouldn't...

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:12.450
You don't know why we're called "Killers."

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:16.120
Killers are people who 
are strong to begin with,

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:18.330
but there's a way for 
them to get stronger.

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:20.750
And it's easy.

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:24.960
You simply absorb.

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:26.500
Absorb?

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:27.460
Absorb what?

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:29.630
Other's lives.

00:16:31.720 --> 00:16:33.550
Absorb their lives and become stronger.

00:16:34.050 --> 00:16:35.890
That's why we're called "Killers."

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:38.470
People's lives?

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:41.020
I-I don't understand...

00:16:41.020 --> 00:16:44.230
But then, shouldn't we have absorbed his?

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:50.480
It's not that easy.

00:16:50.900 --> 00:16:53.280
There's a limit to how many 
one person can absorb.

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:58.530
You have two marks, 
so you can only absorb two.

00:16:59.200 --> 00:17:00.660
There's a limit,

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:03.870
so you should only absorb someone 
when it's more effective.

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:06.080
Effective?

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:09.290
You mean someone stronger?

00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:11.090
Well, well...

00:17:13.010 --> 00:17:15.010
Looks like we don't have time to talk.

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:18.350
He's come to us.

00:17:19.470 --> 00:17:21.430
That's him?

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:22.430
Yes, that's right.

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:25.770
That's the strongest Killer in Tatoland,

00:17:26.770 --> 00:17:27.770
Bays.

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:29.440
Yeah, I did.

00:17:29.440 --> 00:17:30.900
I was bored.

00:17:30.900 --> 00:17:33.280
I'm glad I won't be bored now.

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:37.130
<i>This guy is the strongest 
warrior in Tatoland, Bays?</i>

00:17:38.780 --> 00:17:42.700
<i>I want to see how far my 
strength can take me!</i>

00:17:42.750 --> 00:17:44.200
<i>Okay, let's do this!</i>

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:52.550
<i>I can't advance...</i>

00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:56.800
<i>This is a real fight?</i>

00:17:58.300 --> 00:17:59.180
Good.

00:17:59.550 --> 00:18:01.810
You can judge these things now.

00:18:02.350 --> 00:18:05.310
The fact that you can tell how strong
he is means you're growing.

00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:08.350
If you'd jumped in, you would've died.

00:18:09.060 --> 00:18:10.560
He's strong.

00:18:10.860 --> 00:18:13.030
If we were to seriously fight him here,

00:18:13.030 --> 00:18:15.530
we could lose two of us.

00:18:16.150 --> 00:18:17.150
Two?

00:18:17.150 --> 00:18:18.570
Don't you mean four?

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:20.200
What do we do?

00:18:20.200 --> 00:18:23.240
If we waste time here, 
the operation will fail.

00:18:23.240 --> 00:18:24.580
Very well.

00:18:25.290 --> 00:18:26.100
I'll...

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:30.290
stop him here.

00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:36.050
Stop me?

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:37.880
You?

00:18:38.470 --> 00:18:39.510
Alone?

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:41.510
Yeah. That's right.

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:44.140
Sorry, since you took the 
trouble to come here...

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:53.980
But you're going to vanish 
from the stage here.

00:19:03.990 --> 00:19:05.290
Now, run.

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:11.080
Huh?

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:12.540
A wall of light.

00:19:13.130 --> 00:19:14.920
I can't attack you from the outside,

00:19:14.920 --> 00:19:17.050
but you can't attack it 
from the inside, either.

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:21.510
Stay there and play with 
yourself for a while.

00:19:22.050 --> 00:19:22.680
See ya.

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:32.350
How's it going, Ears?

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:35.360
The decoy squad is working.

00:19:35.770 --> 00:19:37.990
There aren't many enemies 
within the fortress.

00:19:38.860 --> 00:19:42.410
The wall of light holding Bays 
will last twenty minutes at best.

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:45.450
If he gets out we have a problem.

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:48.450
We need to keep going before that happens.

00:19:49.460 --> 00:19:50.540
Wait, guys.

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:52.830
There's a strong aura up ahead.

00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:57.760
He's big... like a fish?

00:19:57.760 --> 00:19:58.760
A fish?

00:19:58.760 --> 00:20:00.970
Probably D. Fisher.

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:01.760
What do we do?

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:04.640
Stop him with another wall of light?

00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:07.390
No, that won't be possible anymore.

00:20:07.890 --> 00:20:10.060
It's not something I can use that often.

00:20:10.810 --> 00:20:15.810
It's a bit risky, but we'll 
have to use another decoy.

00:20:16.980 --> 00:20:18.030
Okay.

00:20:18.030 --> 00:20:19.530
Then I'll be the decoy.

00:20:19.530 --> 00:20:21.650
Don't rush ahead, kid.

00:20:22.150 --> 00:20:25.820
Your job's to destroy the doors 
while the decoy draws him off.

00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:30.410
And you've got a bigger job coming up.

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:32.080
A bigger job?

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:35.540
So, Opal, you're the decoy.

00:20:36.960 --> 00:20:39.050
All right, I'll do it.

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:42.760
Just so we're clear, the fish 
man is stronger than you.

00:20:43.180 --> 00:20:45.510
Draw him off and buy time,

00:20:45.930 --> 00:20:48.000
then withdraw when you have a chance.

00:20:48.340 --> 00:20:49.810
Got it!

00:20:49.810 --> 00:20:51.060
There's no time, right?

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:52.060
Let's go.

00:20:52.520 --> 00:20:56.060
I'll <i>lure</i> him away from you guys.

00:20:57.150 --> 00:21:00.070
Wasn't that funny?

00:21:00.070 --> 00:21:01.400
Not at all.

00:21:02.700 --> 00:21:06.320
The guys fighting outside 
must be having fun.

00:21:06.780 --> 00:21:08.580
I want to smash somebody.

00:21:09.120 --> 00:21:11.580
I hope somebody gets this far.

00:21:21.690 --> 00:21:23.000
There you are.

00:21:28.640 --> 00:21:31.140
Stop moving around!

00:21:32.520 --> 00:21:33.480
Crap!

00:21:38.020 --> 00:21:40.190
<i>Tejirof told me to pull back...</i>

00:21:40.630 --> 00:21:43.190
<i>But I'll defeat him here!</i>

00:21:54.900 --> 00:21:58.830
This is the prison where General 
Alex is being held captive.

00:21:59.220 --> 00:22:00.780
<i>General Alex.</i>

00:22:01.310 --> 00:22:05.150
<i>The man who's said to be 
the strongest in Segua.</i>

00:22:05.960 --> 00:22:08.340
<i>I wonder what he's like.</i>

00:22:16.250 --> 00:22:17.210
No...

00:22:17.590 --> 00:22:18.350
Why?

00:22:20.280 --> 00:22:21.110
Dad?

00:23:40.740 --> 00:23:43.520
I can hold it in better than anybody!

00:23:43.980 --> 00:23:44.880
I was happy...

00:23:45.770 --> 00:23:49.100
I can do anything, if I want.

00:23:49.520 --> 00:23:51.820
Even so, I'm going to keep running,

00:23:51.820 --> 00:23:53.700
towards the center of the world...

00:23:51.820 --> 00:23:54.900
Episode 3 is Being Worked On Right Now!
